  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Production and sale of healthful foods at a fair price and institutional strengthening in the province of Azua.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Visin Social will develop the managerial skills of eight grassroots organizations in the southern province of Azua and work with three of them to market locally-grown and -processed food products and improve their knowledge of nutrition and related subjects. Some 650 families in the communities of Los Tramojos, la Bombita y Las Lomas will benefit directly and an additional 3,250 residents of Azua will benefit indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
